<section class="section"><div class="page-width info-page"><div class="eyebrow">Customer care</div><h1 class="section-title">CARE FOR<br>THE LONG TERM.</h1><div class="info-grid"><div><h2>Product care</h2><p>CHAVÉR pieces are developed as premium everyday essentials. Always follow the final care label inside the garment. As a general rule, wash similar colours together, avoid unnecessary high temperatures and reshape garments while damp.</p></div><div><h2>Before launch</h2><p>Final washing and care instructions are confirmed only after production specifications and quality testing are approved. Product pages will be updated before ordering opens.</p></div><div><h2>Support</h2><p>Need help with a product, fit or future order? Use our contact page and include the product name and your question so we can help you clearly.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pages/contact">Contact CHAVÉR</a></div><div><h2>Returns</h2><p>Returns are not active while ordering is closed. The final returns procedure and statutory information will be published before launch and linked from the footer.</p></div></div></div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"Customer care","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Customer care"}]}{% endschema %}